            <li>Zwaag, J., et al. (2022). The Effects of Cold Exposure Training and a Breathing Exercise on the Inflammatory Response in Humans: A Pilot Study. <em class="text-neutral-400">Psychosomatic Medicine</em>, 84(4), 457–467. <a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/35213875/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-amber-400 hover:underline">[PubMed]</a></li>
